---
// Just the canvas for the rain behind the patterns: black glyphs falling down the white
// background. It carries no meaning, so it is hidden from assistive tech and never takes a
// pointer event.
//
// It has no script of its own on purpose. MatrixMode.astro drives both rains from a single
// module, which keeps the page at one small script instead of three.
---
<div class="code-rain" aria-hidden="true">
  <canvas data-code-rain></canvas>
</div>
